    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by <strong><u>various captcha verification operations</u></strong>. Players can input corresponding text, <strong><u>click on the prompt text in order</u></strong>, d<strong><u>rag the image to the corresponding position</u></strong>, <strong><u>click on the corresponding block</u></strong>, <strong><u>or answer simple elementary </u></strong>and <strong><u>middle school questions through images or text prompts in the game</u></strong>. Complete <strong><u>50 different difficulty verification operations</u></strong> to successfully pass the level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains a large number of internet memes. If you encounter difficulties during gameplay, you can go to Bilibili to seek the correct answer.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by <strong><u>various captcha verification operations</u></strong>. Players can input corresponding text, <strong><u>click on the prompt text in order</u></strong>, d<strong><u>rag the image to the corresponding position</u></strong>, <strong><u>click on the corresponding block</u></strong>, <strong><u>or answer simple elementary </u></strong>and <strong><u>middle school questions through images or text prompts in the game</u></strong>. Complete <strong><u>50 different difficulty verification operations</u></strong> to successfully pass the level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains a large number of internet memes. If you encounter difficulties during gameplay, you can go to Bilibili to seek the correct answer.</p></li></ul>",
